Zap the next yellow mold with it and try to move where it was.
If you don't see the mold any more and you get there, it was teleportation.
If you don't see the mold and you get the message "you hit it", it was
make invisible. Or if you see it and get the message "you hit the invisible
yellow mold", it was make invisible and you can see invisible.
If you still see the mold and the message when you hit it doesn't say
anything about it being invisible, it was cancellation.

Of course, you can replace the yellow mold above with any other 
not-very-dangerous monster that doesn't move or moves very slowly.
I wouldn't recommend on trying with a nymph or a floating eye, for the
obvious reasons..
